#!/bin/bash
#PBS -N cgm_push
#PBS -P 11704243
#PBS -j oe
#   qsub -l select=1:ncpus=8:mem=32gb -l walltime=00:30:00 \
#        -o logs/98_push_report.log scripts/pbs/98_push_report.pbs            # -> qdev
source "${REPO:-$HOME/workspace/Project_CGM/CGM-OutlierMIA-master}/scripts/pbs/env.sh"
set +e
module load git/2.39.2
cd "$REPO"
{
  git add -A
  echo "staged: $(git diff --cached --numstat | wc -l) files"
  git commit -q -F - <<'MSG'
Add the lab notebook: one tab per working day

docs/report/index.html is the argument, and an argument hides its own history --
which of these numbers arrived first, what they replaced, and which days were spent
discovering that a measurement was wrong. docs/report/notebook.html is that record.

Thirteen days, 2026-08-06 to 2026-08-18, one gap on 08-11 when nothing ran.
Reconstructed from artefact mtimes rather than from memory: each day carries what was
run, what came back with the numbers, what it decided, what bit us, and the artefact
paths. Days are tagged built / measured / result / defect found / redirected / cost,
and the timeline bar takes the colour of the day's most consequential tag.

The days that went wrong are in it, because they are most of the story: the attack
design that was measuring which training run it was looking at (08-12), the three
defects in the raw file (08-14), the campaign killed by a walltime budgeted from the
wrong per-model cost (08-16), and the discriminator whose weights were never seeded
(08-18).

Interaction is the same system as the report -- day tabs, arrow keys, a timeline you
can click, a show-every-day-at-once mode that is also what prints, dark mode, and
per-day URL hashes. Nothing is claimed as finished that is not: the two pilots still
running get their own dashed panel after the last day.

check_report_data.py now also verifies the notebook, by recomputing every day's file
count from the mtimes under results/, logs/, docs/, scripts/, src/ and data/cohort/ and
comparing it against the page. It also fails if a day with activity on disk has no
notebook entry. 137 checks, 0 mismatches; the current day is skipped because its count
moves while the check runs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
MSG
  git log --oneline -1
  git -c credential.helper="store --file=$HOME/.git-credentials-github" \
      push origin main 2>&1 | sed -E 's#//[^@]*@#//***@#g'
  echo "push exit ${PIPESTATUS[0]}"
} 2>&1 | tee logs/98_push_report.live.log
